NAME
       ftp - file transfer client

SYNOPSIS
       ftp [-u user] [-p password] [-v] [host [port]]

DESCRIPTION
       Connects to an FTP server and offers an interactive prompt.

OPTIONS
       -u U   log in as U
       -p P   use password P
       -v     show the protocol dialogue

COMMANDS
       open host [port]     connect
       cd dir               change the remote directory
       ls                   list the remote directory
       get remote [local]   download
       put local [remote]   upload
       quit                 disconnect and exit

SEE ALSO
       wget(1), 9p(1), ssh(1)
